       <item>
        <property name="text">
         <string>RX+TX</string>
        </property>
       </item>
       <item>
        <property name="text">
         <string>il2p Only</string>
        </property>
       </item>
       <property name="toolTip">
        <string>IL2P mode — Improved Layer 2 framing. Off / RX only / RX+TX / IL2P only. IL2P-only stations cannot talk to AX.25-only stations.</string>
       </property>
       <property name="whatsThis">
        <string>&lt;b&gt;Channel D IL2P mode&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Improved Layer 2 Protocol — FEC framing that supersedes plain AX.25 on noisy paths. None / RX only / RX+TX (every outgoing frame is sent twice — once IL2P, once plain HDLC for back-compat) / IL2P only (refuses non-IL2P frames). The Send CRC and Check CRC checkboxes on this tab control QtSM's IL2P CRC extension. Stored as &lt;tt&gt;[AX25_D]/IL2P&lt;/tt&gt; (0/1/2/3) and &lt;tt&gt;IL2PCRC&lt;/tt&gt;.</string>
       </property>
      </widget>
